"bgcolor": "#000", "size": [428.1044921875, 620.2369995117188], "pos": [185.9502410888672, 478.8433837890625], "id": 45, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_Nano_Banana2_Image2Image"}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [{"name": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "color": "#222", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["### 第一步：视觉解码与品牌分析 (Visual & Brand Analysis)\n\n1.  **产品类目 (Product_Category):**\n    *   时尚女鞋 / 冬季休闲鞋 / 毛绒乐福鞋 (Shearling-lined Moccasin Loafers)。属于秋冬时尚服饰类目，具体为兼顾保暖与潮流的年轻化鞋履。\n\n2.  **视觉描述 (Visual_Description):**\n    *   **颜色/材质:** 鞋面主体为焦糖色（Camel/Brown）的优质翻毛皮（Suede），表面具有细腻的磨砂绒感。内里和鞋口包裹着厚实的米白色羊羔毛（Shearling/Faux Fur），视觉上极其柔软保暖。\n    *   **形状/设计:** 圆润宽大的鞋头（Round toe），带有明显的莫卡辛（Moccasin）风格缝线。鞋底为加厚的棕色橡胶松糕底（Chunky rubber sole），侧面有防滑纹理。\n    *   **细节:** 鞋带采用粗编织绳（Thick rope laces），系成蝴蝶结形状，具有手工艺感。鞋内标有 \"red dragonfly\"（红蜻蜓）字样。\n\n3.  **品牌调性 (Brand_Vibe):**\n    *   **舒适慵懒 (Cozy & Lazy):** 传达出秋冬季节的温暖感和包裹感。\n    *   **森系文艺 (Mori Style):** 具有自然、复古、日系清新的气息。\n    *   **年轻活力:** 适合年轻女性的日常通勤或周末休闲。\n\n4.  **理想场景 (Ideal_Environment):**\n    *   深秋初冬的户外，铺满落叶的公园小径，或者是温暖的午后阳光下的木质地板/咖啡馆露台。环境色调应以暖黄、红棕、米白为主。\n\n5.  **光影风格 (Lighting_Style):**\n    *   **暖调自然光 (Warm Natural Light):** 模拟“黄金时刻”的侧逆光，强调翻毛皮的质感和羊羔毛的边缘光晕，营造温暖氛围。\n\n6.  **模特画像 (Model_Persona):**\n    *   20-28岁的年轻女性，着装风格为Vintage复古或日系舒适风。穿着堆堆袜（粗针织羊毛袜）、灯芯绒裤子或毛呢半身裙。\n\n7.  **交互动作 (Interaction_Mode):**\n    *   模特穿着鞋子在落叶上自然行走，捕捉脚步特写；或者是坐姿，双脚自然交叉，展示鞋面和内里的毛绒细节。\n\n---\n\n### 第二步：变量标准化 (Variable Definition)\n\n*   **{THE_PRODUCT}:**\n    pair of camel brown suede moccasin loafers, cream white thick shearling wool lining, fluffy fur collar, chunky brown rubber platform sole, visible moccasin stitching, thick textured rope laces tied in a bow, high-quality suede texture, matte finish.\n*   **{THE_MODEL}:**\n    legs of a young female, wearing beige chunky knitted wool socks, vintage brown corduroy trousers, cozy autumn fashion style.\n*   **{THE_INTERACTION}:**\n    standing naturally, stepping on dry fallen leaves, low angle close-up of feet, casual walking stance.\n*   **{THE_SCENE}:**\n    sunlit autumn park path, scattered golden maple leaves on the ground, soft blurred background of trees, warm wooden texture, cozy winter atmosphere.\n*   **{THE_VIBE}:**\n    commercial product photography, soft warm lighting, golden hour sunlight, rim light on fur, shallow depth of field, bokeh, highly detailed texture, 8k resolution, photorealistic, cinematic composition.\n\n---\n\n### 第三步：输出 KV 级大片提示词 (Hero Shot Prompt)\n\n**Midjourney / Stable Diffusion Prompt:**\n\n> **Professional commercial photography, low-angle close-up shot of a pair of premium camel brown suede moccasin loafers with cream white shearling lining and chunky platform soles. The model wears beige chunky knitted wool socks and vintage corduroy trousers, stepping softly on a bed of dry golden maple leaves in a sunlit autumn park. The thick rope laces are tied in a perfect bow. Soft, warm natural sunlight filters through the trees, creating a fuzzy rim light on the fluffy fur collar and highlighting the matte suede texture. Cozy atmosphere, warm color palette, shallow depth of field, creamy bokeh background, ultra-realistic, 8k resolution, shot on Canon EOS R5, 85mm f/1.8 lens. --ar 3:4 --v 6.0**"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 109, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [879.1599731445312, 611.9732055664062], "pos": [-261.2069396972656, 1166.6636962890625], "id": 87, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "color": "#222", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 60, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix",